### TLS certificates ########################################################
# The self-signed DEV cert (docker/certs/server.crt + server.key) is committed
# intentionally — it has no security value (self-signed, local-only).
# NEVER commit real CA-signed private keys. If you replace these with real certs,
# add the key file here:
# docker/certs/*.key

